{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-11-13T12:48:17.164Z","type":"exp.start","exp":"E-HOSTED-BALLOT-DECIDE-LIVE-01","attempt":1,"title":"A decision-only vote on the real hardware room: three members vote with no money in play, a wrong-key vote is refused, the room signs the decision, a browser check verifies it against the attested key, and the round can never be settled","tier":"hardware","hypothesis":"Predictions are in docs/lab/PROGRAMME_PLAN.md, committed before this file existed. A vote with an explicit null share moves no money; the room signs a decision that the browser verifier accepts against the settlement key the hardware attested; asking the room to settle that round is refused; and nothing moves on chain.","limits":["One operator controls every account and the VM. This is the system working on real hardware, not independent parties.","The decision is signed by the room and is not recorded on chain: the contract cannot record a result with no payment. Anyone can check the signature against the room's attested key, but the chain does not show the decision.","The room sees every vote; this hides votes from the other members and the public, not from the room.","The VM exists for the length of the session and is deleted; no hosted room is running."],"requires":["phala-key","near-key","network","docker"],"chain_prev":"e5449c4849ab8c14528b1a32001f3653da7e9b317f26ea3865fa074d8983a795","chain_hash":"9907074b20928005ed79c751d687468807e920cd2dd36a0a7aa90b8c31aaadcf"}
